    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύστροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not forming a solid mass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of style,
				<i>not condensed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Din.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>slack, careless,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξις,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσύστροφος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Grg.</u>
				p.258J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> dub. sens., of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.650
			</span></i>.</div>
